  ok: 9 days old (the reported case) → no stale tasks
  ok: PRIORITIES_STALE_DAYS=1 makes 2 days stale
  ok: no last_updated → its own message
  ok: no last_updated → no list
  ok: unreadable date → its own message
  ok: unreadable date → no list
  ok: date in the future → its own message
  ok: date in the future → no list
  ok: fresh empty list → silent (fallback to yesterday's carry-over)
  ok: DST: 2026-03-28 → 2026-04-01 is 4 days in Europe/Berlin
  ok: DST: 2026-03-07 → 2026-03-11 is 4 days in America/New_York
